This module is derived from and inspired by:

    SourceFuse arc-network
    Repository:  https://github.com/sourcefuse/terraform-aws-arc-network
    License:     Apache License 2.0
    Copyright:   SourceFuse Technologies

The arc-network module provided the architectural blueprint for the public
subnet / private subnet / NAT gateway layout, the variable shape, and the
flow-log + endpoint patterns. Devotica's fork adapts the module for fintech
defaults required by Indian financial-services regulations (RBI circulars,
DPDP Act, SEBI cyber-resilience guidelines), enforces stricter mandatory
tags, and integrates with the central CI/policy stack at
devotica-labs/terraform-shared-config and devotica-labs/terraform-policies.

We thank SourceFuse for publishing arc-network under Apache-2.0.

